## **FLOW 1: UP TO BOTTOM (Top-Down Execution)**

```
CEO (Vision)
    ↓
C-Suite (Strategy) → CFO/COO/CTO/CMO/CHRO/CCO/CIO/CREO/CRO/CMO-HC/CPO/CLO-Log/CAO/CISO/CLO
    ↓
Executive Council (Decisions)
    ↓
Layer Bridge (Translation)
    ↓
CDOO (Digital Strategy)
    ↓
Command Team (Execution Plan) → DDO + WOL + AOD
    ↓
Department AI Heads (Dispatch) → 21 Department Heads
    ↓
PRIVACY AGENT GATE (Data Masking + Context Filter + Permission Enforcer)
    ↓
AI Agents (Action) → 199 Agents across all departments
    ↓
PRIVACY OUTPUT GATE (Sanitizer + Compliance + Audit Logger)
    ↓
OUTPUT (Results)
```

**Example:**
- CEO: "Improve customer satisfaction"
- CCO → CDOO: "Deploy AI support enhancement"
- DDO: "Configure CX agents with new sentiment analysis"
- WOL: "Allocate 5 support bots + enable Learning mode"
- AOD: "Automate escalation workflows"
- CX Agents: Handle tickets with predictive insights
- Output: 98% CSAT, proactive issue prevention

---

## **FLOW 2: BOTTOM TO UP (Bottom-Up Reporting)**

```
AI Agents (Metrics)
    ↓
Department Heads (Aggregation)
    ↓
Command Team (Analysis) → DDO + WOL + AOD
    ↓
CDOO (Review)
    ↓
Layer Bridge (Synthesis)
    ↓
Executive Council (Assessment)
    ↓
C-Suite (Review)
    ↓
CEO (Dashboard)
```

**Example:**
- CX Agents: "Resolved 500 tickets, 95% satisfaction"
- CX Head: "Support performance up 20%"
- WOL: "Agent utilization optimal"
- CDOO: "Digital CX exceeding targets"
- CEO: "CSAT improved 15% this quarter"

