## **SUMMARY TABLE: Three Flows**

| Flow Direction | Purpose | Speed | Data Type |
|----------------|---------|-------|-----------|
| **Up → Bottom** | Execute strategy | Minutes-Hours | Directives, Tasks |
| **Bottom → Up** | Report performance | Hours-Days | Metrics, KPIs, Alerts |
| **Input → Output** | Complete transaction | Seconds-Minutes | Request → Resolution |

