## **A2A Communication (Agent-to-Agent)**

```
CX Agent: "Customer asking about pricing"
    ↓ Consult
Sales Agent: "Here's pricing info + current discount"
    ↓ Inform
CX Agent: "Shares pricing with customer"
    ↓ Escalate (if needed)
Human Agent (WOL managed): Complex negotiation
    ↓ Resolve
Customer: Satisfied
```
